  "content": "\n\n<p>此模組為海洋增添了<strong>巨型災厄戰艦</strong>，船上裝滿了戰利品與珍貴物資。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/951/264/illager-warship.png\" width=\"385\"><img style=\"float:right\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/951/267/loot.png\" width=\"385\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>生成：</strong>戰艦會出現在所有<strong>海洋生物群系</strong>中。</li>\n<li><strong>災厄船員：</strong>這艘戰艦由各類災厄村民守護，負責保護船上的寶藏。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/951/269/side-view.png\" width=\"385\"><img style=\"float:right\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/951/268/rooms.png\" width=\"385\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p>歡迎將此模組用於您的整合包中</p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">也歡迎查看「村民戰艦」模組：</p>\n<p><img style=\"font-weight:400;display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1311/92/ship.png\" width=\"385\" height=\"217\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><a style=\"color:#236fa1\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/villager-warship\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/villager-warship</a></span></p>\n<hr>\n<p>特別感謝 SirBlake</p>",
